  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup water",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "18 (1 ounce) squares bittersweet chocolate",
    "1 cup unsalted butter",
    "6 eggs"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 300 degrees F (150 degrees C). Grease a 10-inch round cake pan; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i8d3VvFs-ZPH63DP4V1PwQFoLNA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-DDMFS-step-01-a12b3bd7e26b4aafad899195a4bca4aa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine sugar, water, and salt in a small saucepan over medium heat. Stir until completely dissolved; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NHl-qez0v7N7B-zCFcBzx3q-h9s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-DDMFS-step-02-edc4c7e6f604495ca018efc8361e0a55.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt bittersweet chocolate in a microwave-safe glass or ceramic bowl in 15-second intervals, stirring after each interval, 1 to 3 minutes. Pour chocolate into the bowl of an electric mixer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ChR5OzPBm1ZuVZKCqWnRwdDHohg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-DDMFS-step-03-41885a608c8c4fc0abc9abeb7ca2e1af.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut butter into pieces; beat butter, one piece at a time, into chocolate until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NtYX7xxhI-GHRVEsLyXMnquVPXo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-DDMFS-step-04-222b3a56ffc6455bb2e5f3bb18ee39a1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in hot sugar water. Slowly beat in eggs, one at a time.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hxQc7iSfmxZjuR5gs-YE5TCu9SY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-DDMFS-step-06-89dd6bb43c3e4853aa1d8aa3569668cb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour batter into the prepared cake pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7Y0q2c5whez51-VL36pGmaHJ7Vg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-DDMFS-step-07-6a7dffcc3aae49e7bd80db829a9b6e5e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Have a pan larger than the cake pan ready; put the cake pan in the larger pan and fill the larger pan with boiling water halfway up the sides of the cake pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/a_AJM2npnb6TutLOO2IH78pxMZM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-DDMFS-step-08-aeffdd32b61a4261bb6839354b2ab969.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake cake in the water bath in the preheated oven for 45 minutes. The center will still look wet. Place cake in the refrigerator until thoroughly chilled, 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KU93To2JGNumKnYI7bGBvBOaZU4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-DDMFS-step-09-de460e55f3404a0fbd2f3b6c5f692f4d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To unmold, dip the bottom of the cake pan in hot water for 10 seconds and invert onto a serving plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UP_RPAwSrPY5bSDqPJAvND0hrFU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-DDMFS-step-010-3fc5699da19142288373fccae5b84503.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/knnwKGyuUTgmPBqhb9pv8UzxyxU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8149-flourless-chocolate-cake-i-DDMFS-beauty-4x3_2-2d297952a8134893a4d46fd8bd1e29e9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8149/step_10.webp"
    }
  ],
